{"seq":24,"slug":"game-performance-optimization","title":"游戏性能优化与剖析","stage":"DONE","category":"game-development","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization","rating":{"composite":3.59,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 游戏性能优化与剖析\n\n一款游戏跑得流畅与否，最终落在一个残酷的算术上：每一帧留给你的时间是固定的，60 FPS 只有 16.7 毫秒，而你要在这段时间里完成输入处理、游戏逻辑、物理、动画、剔除、绘制提交，再等 GPU 把画面渲染出来。性能优化不是「让代码更快」的浪漫追求，而是「在帧预算内塞下所有必须做的事」的工程纪律。这个 hub 围绕这条纪律展开，把零散的优化技巧组织成一条从理解到落地的完整链路。\n\n整个 hub 分四条主线，层层递进。第一条是「基础」：先讲清楚为什么 60 FPS 不是越高越好而是越稳越好，再把一帧的时间拆成可分配的预算，最后建立「先测量、再优化、用数据说话」的剖析方法论。没有这层地基，后面所有手段都会沦为凭感觉的瞎猜。\n\n第二条主线是「CPU 优化」。当帧时间花在 CPU 上时，问题往往出在三个地方：主线程做了太多本可以摊开的工作、内存访问模式对缓存不友好、以及多核没有被充分利用。这一章依次攻克 CPU 瓶颈的定位、面向数据的缓存友好布局，以及把工作切成作业喂给多个核心的并行模型。\n\n第三条主线是「GPU 与内存」。画面复杂度上来后，瓶颈会转移到 GPU 与内存带宽：填充率、绘制调用数量、纹理与缓冲的驻留压力。这一章讲如何判断 GPU 到底卡在哪个阶段，如何用批处理和实例化把成千上万次绘制调用压成几次，以及如何在有限的显存和内存里管理资源生命周期、避免卡顿与崩溃。\n\n第四条主线是「工程实践」，把前三章的理论落到真实项目里。它覆盖主流引擎的剖析工具怎么用、不同平台（主机、移动、PC）各有什么独特约束、以及那些反复坑人的陷阱与必须做的权衡——比如过早优化、微优化错地方、画质与帧率的取舍。\n\n四条主线的关系是：基础教你怎么看，CPU 与 GPU 两章教你怎么改，工程实践教你在真实约束下怎么落地。读完整个 hub，你应该能拿到一份卡顿的帧，定位瓶颈在 CPU 还是 GPU，找到具体的热点，选对优化手段，并理解每个优化背后牺牲了什么。性能优化的终极目标始终如一：在那固定的十几毫秒里，把手上的硬件榨到极限。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-performance-matters","title":"为什么性能关键","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/foundations/why-performance-matters"},{"seq":2,"slug":"frame-budget","title":"帧预算","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/foundations/frame-budget"},{"seq":3,"slug":"profiling-methodology","title":"剖析方法论","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/foundations/profiling-methodology"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cpu","title":"CPU 优化","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cpu-bottlenecks","title":"CPU 瓶颈","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu/cpu-bottlenecks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cache-data-oriented","title":"缓存与数据导向","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu/cache-data-oriented"},{"seq":3,"slug":"multithreading-jobs","title":"多线程与作业系统","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/cpu/multithreading-jobs"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"gpu-memory","title":"GPU 与内存","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"gpu-bottlenecks","title":"GPU 瓶颈","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/gpu-bottlenecks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"draw-calls-batching","title":"绘制调用与批处理","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/draw-calls-batching"},{"seq":3,"slug":"memory-management","title":"内存管理","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/gpu-memory/memory-management"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"工程实践","docCount":3,"url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"profiling-tools","title":"剖析工具","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/practice/profiling-tools"},{"seq":2,"slug":"platform-optimization","title":"平台优化","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/practice/platform-optimization"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pitfalls-tradeoffs","title":"陷阱与权衡","url":"/h/game-development/game-performance-optimization/practice/pitfalls-tradeoffs"}]}]}